- Issue 14 reconciles recorded operation intents and requires explicit resume. Question/approval modules and production execution/validation predecessors remain absent, so their interruption paths require later wiring and regression evidence. Linux/Windows process trees and live shutdown remain unverified. See [recovery](features/workflow-recovery.md).

